Team A.C.T. is only named in Pokémon Mystery Dungeon: Team Go-Getters Out of the Gate! and Pokémon Super Mystery Dungeon. In Red and Blue Rescue Team, their remake, and the , they are simply referred to as "Alakazam's team".

